migrations/
# Build artifacts regenerated inside the image by build.rs (`npm ci` and
# `npm run build`). Sending them wastes ~420MB of build context, and shipping a
# host-built ui/dist would let the image inherit assets that were never compiled
# in the container — masking a broken UI build instead of failing on it.
ui/node_modules/
ui/dist/